 CIV {
  coords 3413.514 61.4 3400.021
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "I am a local shop owner who has gotten in too deep. For the past three months, I have been supplying Russian forces with information on the CDF. Unfortunately, it seems my involvement has finally caught up with me."\
  ""\
  "25 minutes ago, I received a phone call from Russian intelligence informing me that a CDF hit squad was on its way to eliminate me. Fortunately, they assured me that they were also dispatching 12 of their elite soldiers to secure my location and extract me to safety."\
  ""\
  "Both CDF and Russian forces will be arriving shortly. I must arm myself with the MP5 stored in the crate and hold out until friendly forces arrive."\
  ""\
  "<b>I MUST remain alive at all costs. If I am killed, all the intelligence I possess will be lost.</b>"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "CIV"
  }
  {
